OL,3,GNEWSANew machine could be part of
OL,4,Acouncil pothole push
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new pothole repair machine would only
OL,7,Fbe part of a council's "armoury" to fix
OL,8,Froads, a senior councillor has said.
OL,10,FReform UK-run Norfolk County Council is
OL,11,Ftrialling the vehicle from JCB ` which
OL,12,Fsays it can fix a "typical pothole" in
OL,13,Feight minutes ` over the next week.
OL,15,FThe Liberal Democrats have questioned
OL,16,Fthe plan as officials at Leicestershire
OL,17,FCounty Council previously raised
OL,18,Fconcerns about its effectiveness on
OL,19,Frural roads.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
