OL,3,GNEWSANew machine could be part of
OL,4,Acouncil pothole push
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform's Tom Dickerson said no decision
OL,7,Fwould be made until staff and
OL,8,Fcontractors had fully assessed whether
OL,9,Fit would help maintain around 6,200
OL,10,Fmiles (10,000km) of road the council is
OL,11,Fresponsible for.
